@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@nurseToken = replace-with-nurse-access-token
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-access-token
@patientId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@staffId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
@patientMessageId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003
@issuanceKey = patient-onboarding-example-001
@resetKey = patient-reset-example-001

### Nurse issues PATIENT only; repeat exact key/body to recover an uncertain response
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/org/patient-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{nurseToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{issuanceKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"patientId":"{{patientId}}"}

### Role injection must return 400
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/org/patient-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{nurseToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{issuanceKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"patientId":"{{patientId}}","role":"ADMIN"}

### ADMIN reads the account linked by Staff UUID
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/org/profile-accounts/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### NURSE reads the account linked by Patient UUID
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/org/profile-accounts/patient/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{nurseToken}}

### NURSE requests a system-generated patient password reset
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/org/patient-accounts/{{patientId}}/password
Authorization: Bearer {{nurseToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{resetKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### NURSE checks latest patient credential-mail delivery status
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/org/patient-accounts/{{patientId}}/mail-delivery
Authorization: Bearer {{nurseToken}}

### NURSE retries one failed patient mail delivery
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/org/patient-accounts/{{patientId}}/mail-delivery/{{patientMessageId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{nurseToken}}
